# Forms

- Always Formik + Yup for forms
- Define reusable Yup schemas (not inline one-offs when shared)
- Use `useFormik` or `<Formik>`
- Submit via Redux thunks — not direct API calls in the form component

```ts
const validationSchema = Yup.object({
  email: Yup.string().email().required(),
  name: Yup.string().required(),
});

const formik = useFormik({
  initialValues: { email: "", name: "" },
  validationSchema,
  onSubmit: (values) => dispatch(submitForm(values)),
});
```
